docs/adr-029-pinned-versions.md:19:The supported Node engine is `>=24.19.0`. The named tested combination is more specific: Node 26.12.1, npm 11.20.0, Playwright 1.64.1 and Chromium 156.0.8078.4. The README records successful verification on that named set. That is evidence for the named set, not a statement that every supported Node version has already been exercised.
